{"content_html": "<html><body><div>\n<figure></figure>\n<figure>\n<div>\n<div><picture><img alt=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/774719029-1351936667147274-3470058731627560416-n-1540.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/774719029-1351936667147274-3470058731627560416-n-1540.jpg?width=0&amp;s=68Bcdt7ju2azAPsxJ698VQ\"/></picture></div>\n<div><picture><img alt=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/ca-si-hoa-minzy-quan-quyt-ben-dai-uy-thang-van-cuong-mc-dan-le-goi-cam-1541.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/ca-si-hoa-minzy-quan-quyt-ben-dai-uy-thang-van-cuong-mc-dan-le-goi-cam-1541.jpg?width=0&amp;s=aSpZsGoCvnBxSa05k5ahLQ\"/></picture></div>\n</div>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn/van-hoa-giai-tri/the-gioi-sao\">Sao Việt</a> 15/8: Ca sĩ Hòa Minzy và chồng sắp cưới - đại úy Thăng Văn Cương \"quấn như sam\" sau thời gian xa cách. </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"773708394_29020155544241655_5252630344496548516_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/773708394-29020155544241655-5252630344496548516-n-1542.jpg?width=0&amp;s=1xtguHpq7A5EAj-lsxonPw\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>MC Đan Lê gợi cảm.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"774033571_1385333880201798_7421930888122797488_n (1).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/774033571-1385333880201798-7421930888122797488-n-1-1543.jpg?width=0&amp;s=CIBIZ7hYgl9RGx2oDRRsAQ\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>NSND Tạ Minh Tâm cùng 2 con gái làm lễ tạ mộ mới xây cho vợ ở quê.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"773761586_27714255598217042_8613637936322132248_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/773761586-27714255598217042-8613637936322132248-n-1544.jpg?width=0&amp;s=0VecaJ1c_OhYx3sP2LPwhw\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Ca sĩ Noo Phước Thịnh hài hước: \"Vì lúc cần cả thế giới đều bận nên mình xin phép bận lại với cả thế giới\".</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"774184639_122187063164781993_7892756073829901274_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/774184639-122187063164781993-7892756073829901274-n-1545.jpg?width=0&amp;s=D5B3qdOwBKpyStnIG_csqA\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Ca sĩ Gemini Hùng Huỳnh điển trai.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"774033571_1385333880201798_7421930888122797488_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/774033571-1385333880201798-7421930888122797488-n-1546.jpg?width=0&amp;s=B5Tkb6X54LezF38B-ERUfQ\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Diễn viên Trương Thanh Long khoe hình thể vạm vỡ.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"774719029_1351936667147274_3470058731627560416_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/774719029-1351936667147274-3470058731627560416-n-1547.jpg?width=0&amp;s=UZDx85Uqzbf_fQb-uN6aog\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>NSND Bùi Công Duy lịch lãm.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"774496514_1382155380560012_7088349295719733957_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/774496514-1382155380560012-7088349295719733957-n-1548.jpg?width=0&amp;s=MdAygCfrRFyLwHP7bwG77g\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Ca sĩ Tăng Duy Tân đón sinh nhật bên fan.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"773232700_1044498425003382_9090163565506987038_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/773232700-1044498425003382-9090163565506987038-n-1549.jpg?width=0&amp;s=BGRI0EPHHgWGUEA8dPUSmA\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Ca sĩ Quang Vinh thú nhận lười tập gym.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"773708394_29020155544241655_5252630344496548516_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/773708394-29020155544241655-5252630344496548516-n-1550.jpg?width=0&amp;s=5d9Ssss0cwsiwnhEPmeh-A\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Đạo diễn Mai Thế Hiệp thân thiết hot boy Nguyễn Tùng Dương. </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"camly.jpeg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/15/camly-1551.jpeg?width=0&amp;s=IqYlCrF470bc_rhKo-HdyQ\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Ca sĩ Cẩm Ly đăng ảnh hiền thục dịu dàng.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>=&gt; Xem thêm những hình ảnh <a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn/lang-sao-tag12088883797313845933.html\">làng sao</a> mới nhất trên VietNamNet</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Tú Liên</strong></p>\n<p>Ảnh: FBNV</p>\n<article><a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn/cuong-do-la-bat-khoc-vi-ba-xa-cuu-nguoi-mau-